window.products.push({"id":128013,"name":"LeafLoveLife - Premium Pour Over Coffee Filter - Standard 1-to-4 Set Cup Stainless Steel, Ultra-Fine Double Mesh Paperless Dripper Cone with Silicone,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.86,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BJi4vtv0L._AC_SL1248_.jpg","description":"Unbelievably Fresh and Delicious Coffee in Every Cup Enjoy Barista Quality Coffee in Your Own Home A Cup of Coffee You’ll Never Forget If you’re a coffee lover, you know firsthand how annoying a paper filter can be. They’re flimsy, they change the taste of your coffee, and they sap aromas and flavors. That’s why we came up with a better solution for coffee drinkers; the LeafLoveLife Pour Over Coffee Filter. Crafted with ultra-fine mesh to reduce sediment in your coffee cup but while also retaining bolder tastes and smells, it’s like getting a barista in your kitchen with every cup. Product Details: Premium Food-Grade Stainless Steel Lightweight, Portable Design Craft Single Cups Compatible with Coffee Cup, Mug and Thermos Rust and Corrosion Resistant Ultra-Fine Double Mesh Filter Dishwasher Safe LeafLoveLife products are all backed by a 1-year warranty as well as a free exchange, free return policy you can trust for true quality assurance. Stainless Steel Durability Turning a regular cup of coffee into the best coffee you’ve ever had can now be done with our premium coffee dripper. Simply place it over the top of your cup with the grounds inside, pour in your piping hot water, let seep a bit, then enjoy; it’s that simple. And when you’re done, just pop in the dishwasher and it’ll be ready for your next cup! Easy to Use, Easier to Love These pour over coffee filters work with a wide range of cups and mugs to let you craft the perfect cup of coffee every time. Crafted with an ultra-fine steel mesh, even the finest coffee grounds won’t slide through into your cup and you don’t even need a paper filter! The stainless steel, reusable pour over enhances the flavors and aromas of your favorite coffee blends while also retaining essential nutrients.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BJi4vtv0L._AC_SL1248_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LeafLoveLife","source_asin":"B01N11L8JD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128013","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N11L8JD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N11L8JD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
