window.products.push({"id":128048,"name":"LifePlus Commercial Ice Maker Machine – 70lbs/24H, 32 Ice Cubes in 11-20 Minutes, Freestanding Undercounter Ice Machine with 10lbs Storage Bin, 2 Ways","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CJoIbdgML._SL1001_.jpg","description":"When the weekend coming, your friends and family share happy experiences and eat potato chips together, but the ice is run out and it takes too long to make ice in the refrigerator, what terrible!Have to buy ice cubes? No, this ice maker will perfectly avoid these situations.LIFEPLUS commercial ice maker machine can produce 70LBS of high-quality Ice in 24 Hrs and get 32 pieces of clear ice in one cycle within 11-20 mins. Why choose LIFEPLUS ice maker machine 1. LIFEPLUS ice maker adopts full stainless steel material, which is more durable, elegant, and easy to clean.2. The thickened foam layer effectively isolating external heat and providing better insulation. Even the power is off the ice can keep 5-8 hours.3. Can change ice sizes, small ice for the coke or other drinkings, medium ice for beer or cocktails, large ice for food fresh.4. Has an automatic stop switch when ice reaches capacity. A light will indicate when the ice storage is full.5. Have 2 ways add water, add the bucker water directly to get delicious ice cubes Feature: - Make 32 pieces of clear ice in one cycle within 11-20 mins- Make 70 LBS of Ice in 24 Hrs- 10 LBS of ice storage bin- Auto Cleaning- Automatic overflow prevention- The largest ice cube size: 0.87”*0.87”*0.79” Specifications: - Power: 120V/60Hz- Ice making current: 1.9A- Ice harvest current: 2.7A- Ice trays number: 32 trays- Protection against electric shock: Ⅰ Level- Tap water inlet pressure: 100-800KPa- Refrigerant: R134a- Gross / net weight: 46.2 / 42.9 LBS Package included: -1 x LIFEPLUS Commercial Ice Machine-1 x Water Supply Hose-1 x Drain Hose-2 x Tube Connector-1 x Ice Scoop-1 x Product Use Guide Note: You do need to transfer the ice to your freezer as it doesn’t keep it cold over long periods of time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CJoIbdgML._SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LifePlus","source_asin":"B09493PV32","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128048","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09493PV32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B09493PV32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
