window.products.push({"id":128081,"name":"Whirlpool WP2186494B OEM Refrigerator Water Filter Cap, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RhftrC+lL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"The Black Refrigerator Water Filter Cap is located at the base of your refrigerator. To replace it, simply extract the water filter and then remove the filter cap by turning it counterclockwise. Installing the new cap is as easy as turning it clockwise and locking it into place. After the replacement, make sure to purge the air from the water lines and check that your refrigerator's water dispenser functions properly. This high-quality, durable replacement filter cap is easy to install and requires no basic hand tools, appliance disassembly, or repair experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RhftrC+lL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whirlpool","source_asin":"B072YWTYCN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128081","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072YWTYCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B072YWTYCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
