window.products.push({"id":128450,"name":"Techecook 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse - Replacement for Whirl-pool Dryers - Compatible with Part 3388651 WP3392519VP 694511 Thermal Fuse (9 Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZKKQ1ln0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【ITEM SPECIALITY & DURABLE】--- Thermal fuse WP3392519 shuts down the dryer when it starts to overheat.It is a safety mechanism that protects your dryer and other equipment by preventing current from flowing into the heating element when the dryer overheats.The replacement part is made from durable high-quality material and well-tested by the manufacturer. ✅【PACKAGE INCLUDES】--- Includes 9 x 3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse which Product length 2 inches, width 0.55 inches, plug length 0.5 inches, width 0.24 inches. The Package Dimensions is 4.92 x 3.54 x 1.22 inches and weight 1.13 ounces. ✅【90-DAYS WARRANTY】---During the warranty period, if the Thermal fuse for WP3392519 has any quality problem , Please contact us in time, we will send you a new replacement or arrange a full refund, no need to return. Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. ✅【COMPATIBLE MODEL】---3392519 Dryer Thermal Fuse fit for Whirlpoo.l and Kenmor.e dryer.►Whirlpool dryer thermal fuse replaces part numbers： 21900, 39800, 214500, 80005, 694511, 3388651, 3392519, ET401, G4AP0500, WP3392519, WP3392519VP Dryer Thermal Fuse. ✅【DIY INSTALLATION】---Disconnect the power before installing this 3392519 thermal fuse. Wear work gloves to protect your hands.The installation needs to use screwdriver. Unscrewing some 1/4 inch nut things from the back of the dryer, unplugging the two wires from this fuse, unscrewing the old fuse, then screwing in the new one and plugging in two wires. You can find the repair video on YouTube and follow it to install it.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZKKQ1ln0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08T97Q35Y","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128450","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T97Q35Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T97Q35Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
