window.products.push({"id":128554,"name":"JEERBLY Portable Ice Maker Machine for Countertop, 26lbs/Day Ice Maker Countertop with 1.54lbs Ice Storage Capacity, Make Ice Cubes in 8min Compact Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XjP-7Q7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍻【Enjoy fresh ice fast just 8mins】 Within 8 minutes one cycle, round and smooth bullet-shaped ice is ready for you. Makes ice cubes with the 1.54lbs capacity for ice storing at a time to make up to 26lbs per day. Ice maker machine will bring you convenience and efficiency on ice making. --- With portable and compact design, whenever and wherever you are, ice is there. 🍹【Chewing ice cubes brings a crispy sound】The bullet-shaped ice pairs well with cool drinks, the cleaner ice retains the flavors of the beverage so you have a tasty treat to chew. Fast ice making and large ice storage capacity allows ice maker machine to meet ice cube demands of your daily use. --- For anyone who enjoys an icy beverage, smooth ice may be your new go-to drinks companion. 🥂【Indicators will remind you if ice is ready】 Equipped with a powerful 100W compressor to cool, it will be a mighty addition to your under counter. The intuitive one-button operation makes start-up a snap. It also has a feature that tells you if it needs water, or if ice is ready or if it needs cleaning. All for your convenience! --- Best of all, you can adjust the thickness of the ice cubes according to your needs, letting you create perfect drinks! 🍺【Efficient & Quiet Cooling is important】This is not a noisy, heat producing appliance. Best ice maker countertop are equipped with a quick and quiet cooling system. This not only helps you save energy, but it also keeps ice maker machine cool and ensures a quiet environment. --- Your friends or family members will always get clear, fresh and healthy ice cube by using this countertop ice maker machine. 🧊【Not take up much space at all】With free-standing design, ice maker machine is easy to carry and operate, like bar, tea shop, KTV, kitchen and office. It can produce more pure ice cubes. So It can offer healthy ice cubes for you, ensuring your eating safety. --- Ice machine makes ice cube much faster than fridge, you can quickly get ice cubes use to fruits, vegetables, frozen foods, beers, drinkings and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XjP-7Q7PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jeerbly","source_asin":"B0919QM6D8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128554","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0919QM6D8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0919QM6D8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
