window.products.push({"id":128578,"name":"MCK49049101 Dryer Lint Filter Cover by Beaquicy - Replacement for Ken-more L-G Dryer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gMyLAiTtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【𝙋𝙍𝙊𝘿𝙀𝙐𝘾𝙏 𝘿𝙀𝙎𝘾𝙍𝙄𝙋𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉】---MCK49049101 Dryer Lint Filter Cover can be used with ADQ56656401 to enclose and support the lint screen in the exhaust air duct and provide comprehensive protection for the lint trap filter of the dryer. New replacement dryer lint filter cover for your dryer helps increase airflow to maximize drying efficiency and help reduce drying times. Dimensions:16.7\" x 11.8\" x 2\". The package includes 1 x MCK49049101 Dryer Lint Screen Housing. 【𝘾𝙊𝙈𝙋𝘼𝙏𝙄𝘽𝙄𝙇𝙄𝙏𝙔】---MCK49049101 L-G dryer filter cover replacement for L-G, Ken-more dryer.◆Replaces part numbers: 1464160, AP5071745, EAP3534930, PS3534930, 79680512900, 79680518900, 79681022900, 79681028900, 79681029900, 79681182310, 79681282310, DLEX3470W, DLEX3370R, DLEX3370V, DLEX3360W, DLEX3470V, DLGX3371R, DLGX3371V, DLGX3371W, DLE3050W, DLEX3360R, etc. 【𝟵𝟬 𝘿𝘼𝙔𝙎 𝙒𝘼𝙍𝙍𝘼𝙉𝙏𝙔】--- The MCK49049101 Dryer Lint Filter Cover supports 90 days return and exchange.Our company attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer. If you have any questions during shopping, please contact customer service in time. We will try our best to solve the problem.Thanks. 【𝘿𝙄𝙔 𝙄𝙉𝙎𝙏𝘼𝙇𝙇𝘼𝙏𝙄𝙊𝙉】---Unplug the dryer before installing MCK49049101 L-G dryer filter cover. Wear work gloves to protect your hands during the repair.Unscrew the screw, remove the old Dryer Lint Filter Cover, install the new one, and screw back the screw. The part fix the following symptoms:①lint filter pops up②doesn't fit properly③lint filter is catching on clothes. It should be noted that do not operate the dryer without the lint filter trap installed. 【𝙃𝙄𝙂𝙃 𝙌𝙐𝘼𝙇𝙄𝙏𝙔】---These MCK49049101 l-g dryer lint screen cover replacement parts are made of good quality materials and well-tested by the manufacturer to ensure the best performance for your dryer. It can capture the lint and debris in the exhaust gas flowing from the dryer, which helps to increase the air volume and improve the drying efficiency, easy to clean,easy to install.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61gMyLAiTtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0895N7L9G","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0895N7L9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0895N7L9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
