window.products.push({"id":128725,"name":"AINUOO Ice Maker, Self-Cleaning Ice Machine with Ice Scoop and Basket, 40 Lbs in 24 Hours, Chewable Pebble Ice Ready in 10 Mins, Portable Nugget Ice M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QO8cBiCfL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊Ideal Ice for Ice Lovers: Also known as chewable ice or pebble ice. The appearance is crystal clear like rock candy, very beautiful. Small particles, crisp texture, easy to chew and good taste. While enjoying the drink, you can chew delicious nugget ice cube to your heart's content. For those who like iced drinks, AINUOO nugget ice maker may be your favorite companion. 🧊Quick Ice Making: AINUOO ice maker is equipped with a high-efficiency compressor. Just wait 10 minutes to get the first ice. Up to 40Lbs per 24 hours, equipped with an ice basket that holds up to 4.85Lbs and a 3.2L water reservoir. Your family will never run out of fresh ice cubes. 🧊Convenient - Self-Cleaning Function: You only need to add water to the tank and touch the CLEAN button to start auto cleaning. This function makes cleaning a breeze and greatly simplifies daily maintenance. Moreover, every time you turn on the ice machine, it will do self-cleaning process before ice making. Ensure you can enjoy hygienic and fresh nugget ice. 🧊A Good Helper for Happy Life: Latest nugget ice making technology, simple control panel and intelligible indicators, stainless steels housing, visible window, compact size, small footprint occupation and more. Every effort is made for fancy appearance and easy application. AINUOO helps improve your quality of life and happiness. 🧊One-Year Warranty, Risk-Free Shopping: Customer satisfaction is our long-term pursuit. AINUOO ice makers entitle 12-month warranty or refund. Each nugget ice maker is equipped with an ice basket and an ice scoop. Make sure that these accessories are present when you receive the goods, and if there are any missing, or you encounter any issue with AINUOO ice maker, feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QO8cBiCfL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AINUOO","source_asin":"B0B458MNZG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128725","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B458MNZG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B458MNZG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
