window.products.push({"id":128985,"name":"Updated W10276397 Washer Drain Pump by Techecook - Compatible for Ken-more Whirl-pool Washing Machine - Replaces 1874334 LP397 AP6018417 PS11751719 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.37,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MI-2U82ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔✔【POWERFUL FEATURES】:w10276397 washer drain pump is located on the back of the washing machine and pumped during the drain cycle. W10276397 Washing machine drain pump helps to drain water from the washing machine and activates after maintaining rotation speed for a period of time. When the washer drain pump b40-3a fails, your washing machine may not be able to drain properly, so you need to replace the wpw10276397.Specifications of this W10276397 washing machine drainage pump: 60Hz, 120V, 0.95A, Class 105 ✔✔【B40-3A DRAIN PUMP】:Package including 1 x W10276397 washer drain pump. The W10276397 b40-3a washing machine drain pump is made of rugged ABS and metal and is well tested by the manufacturer for durability and ease of use, which is free of harmful chemicals to ensure long-lasting and effective performance, high quality stainless steel metal makes the pump less susceptible to water vapor in the washing machine, preventing rust on the pump, preventing cracks and leaks during installation and use ✔✔【2-YEARS WARRANTY】:During the 2 YEARS warranty period, if the Washer Drain Pump W10276397 has quality problem or other reasons, we support return, replacement or refund.Customer satisfaction is our unremitting pursuit. Whirl-pool washer drain pump b40-3a solves the problems of washing machines: no drainage, pumping but no rotation, leaks, noise.wpw10276397 washer drain pump makes the washing machine run more quietly and smoothly, maintaining good drainage function ✔✔【HIGH COMPATIBILITY】:W10276397 b40-3a drain pump is compatible with Whirl-pool, Ken-more, May-tag, Ama-na washing machines.Replace 11020022010, 11020022011, 11020022012, 11020022013, 11020102310, 11020102311, 11020112310, 11021102010, ntw4700yq1, wtw5700xl2, Wtw4800bq0, mvwc200xw1, ntw4610yq0, cae2743bq0, 7mmvwc200yw0, 7mmvwc210yw0, 7mmvwc300yw0, 7mmvwc300yw1, 7mwtw1500aq0, 7mwtw1501aw0, 7mwtw1501aw1, 7mwtw1502aw0, mvwc450xw4, wtw4880aw1, etc ✔✔【EASY INSTALLATION】:Before installing the W10276397 washing machine drain pump, remember to unplug the washing machine from the power supply as a safety precaution. Remove the defective drain pump from the machine. Install carefully in the same place with the new gasket. Repair the electrical and hydraulic connections of the drainage pump by verifying and supervising the correct operation of the machine. You can find the installation video on YouTube","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61MI-2U82ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Techecook","source_asin":"B08T934PS5","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-128985","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08T934PS5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B08T934PS5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
